#: ../../language/error_codes/E0090.md:1
msgid "E0090"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0090.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `unused_lexcase`"
msgstr "警告名称：`unused_lexcase`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0090.md:5
msgid "A `lexmatch` or `lexscan` branch can never be selected."
msgstr "`lexmatch` 或 `lexscan` 的某个分支永远无法被选中。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0090.md:7
msgid ""
"This happens when an earlier branch takes precedence for every input matched "
"by the later branch, or when the branch's regex matches no input. An "
"unnecessary catch-all after exhaustive regex cases produces the same warning."
msgstr ""
"当较早的分支对后续分支能匹配的每个输入都具有优先权，或该分支的正则无法匹配任"
"何输入时，就会出现此警告。在穷尽的正则分支之后出现不必要的兜底分支，也会产生"
"同一警告。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0090.md:11
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0090.md:13
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn classify(text : String) -> String {\n"
"  lexmatch text {\n"
"    re\"^a.*$\" => \"starts with a\"\n"
"    re\"^ab.*$\" => \"starts with ab\"\n"
"    _ => \"other\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0090.md:17
msgid ""
"The first branch already handles every string that starts with `\"ab\"`, so "
"the second branch is unreachable under first-match semantics."
msgstr ""
"第一个分支已经处理所有以 `\"ab\"` 开头的字符串，因此在首次匹配语义下，第二个"
"分支不可达。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0090.md:20
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0090.md:22
msgid ""
"Remove the unreachable branch, or move a more specific regex before the "
"branch that shadows it."
msgstr "删除不可达分支，或将更具体的正则移到遮蔽它的分支之前。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0090.md:25
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn classify(text : String) -> String {\n"
"  lexmatch text {\n"
"    re\"^ab.*$\" => \"starts with ab\"\n"
"    re\"^a.*$\" => \"starts with a\"\n"
"    _ => \"other\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
